{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30648","headline":"送贺知章入道 · 姚鹄","name":"送贺知章入道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若非尧运及垂衣，肯许巢由脱俗机。\n太液始同黄鹤下，仙乡已驾白云归。\n还披旧褐辞金殿，却捧玄珠向翠微。\n羁束慙无仙药分，随车空有梦魂飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}